; Example Beancount ledger for obsidian-flat-financing.
; The plugin RENDERS this file — add data by appending balanced transactions.
; Every transaction's postings must sum to zero (omit one amount to infer it).

2026-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking      USD
2026-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Savings       USD
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries   USD
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Transport        USD
2026-01-01 open Income:Salary             USD
2026-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances   USD

2026-01-01 * "Opening balance"
  Assets:Bank:Checking     1500.00 USD
  Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-08-01 * "Acme Corp" "August salary"
  Income:Salary          -4000.00 USD
  Assets:Bank:Checking    4000.00 USD

2026-08-02 * "Grocery Store" "Weekly shop" #reimbursable
  Expenses:Food:Groceries    42.50 USD
  Assets:Bank:Checking      -42.50 USD

2026-08-03 * "Metro" "Monthly transit pass" #commute
  Expenses:Transport        75.00 USD
  Assets:Bank:Checking     -75.00 USD

; Optional balance assertion: 1500 + 4000 - 42.50 - 75.00 = 5382.50
2026-08-04 balance Assets:Bank:Checking   5382.50 USD
